{# Privacy Policy draft. Not legal advice; needs attorney review. #}
{% extends "_layout.html.j2" %}
{% block body %}
<p>Effective: {{ f('effective_date') }}</p>
<p>{{ f('legal_name') }} ({{ f('postal_address') }}) runs {{ f('app_title') }}. This policy explains what personal data we collect, why,
who else handles it, and your choices. Privacy requests: <a href="mailto:{{ f('privacy_email') }}">{{ f('privacy_email') }}</a>.</p>

<h2>What we collect</h2>
{% if data_collected %}<ul>{% for item in data_collected %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
{% else %}<p>{{ f('data_collected') }}</p>{% endif %}
<p>We do not sell personal data{% if not sells_goods %} and we do not run advertising{% endif %}.</p>

<h2>Why we use it</h2>
<p>To provide and secure the service, sign you in, answer your messages{% if sells_goods or subscriptions %}, take payment and keep tax records{% endif %},
and meet legal duties.</p>

<h2>Who else handles it</h2>
{% if processors %}<ul>{% for p in processors %}<li><strong>{{ p.name }}</strong>: {{ p.purpose }} ({{ p.location }})</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
{% else %}<p>{{ f('processors') }}</p>{% endif %}

<h2>Where it is stored and for how long</h2>
<p>Stored in: {{ f('data_location') }}. Kept: {{ f('retention') }}.</p>

<h2>Cookies</h2>
<p>See the <a href="{{ base_path }}/cookies.html">cookie notice</a>.</p>

<h2>Your choices and account deletion</h2>
{% if accounts %}<p>You can delete your account yourself from your account page; we then erase the data we hold about you, except what the law
requires us to keep{% if sells_goods or subscriptions %} (for example tax and payment records){% endif %}.</p>{% endif %}
<p>To see, correct, export or delete your data, write to <a href="mailto:{{ f('privacy_email') }}">{{ f('privacy_email') }}</a>.
We answer within 30 days. We will not treat you worse for using these rights.</p>

{% if tx %}
<h2>Texas residents</h2>
<p>Under the Texas Data Privacy and Security Act you may ask to confirm, access, correct, delete or obtain a copy of your personal data,
and to opt out of targeted advertising, sale of data and profiling. If we refuse a request you may appeal by replying to our answer.</p>
{% endif %}
{% if ca %}
<h2>California residents</h2>
<p>Under the CCPA/CPRA you may ask what we collected about you in the last 12 months, to correct or delete it, and to opt out of sale or
sharing. We do not sell or share personal information for cross-context advertising. You will not be discriminated against for using these rights.</p>
{% endif %}
{% if eu %}
<h2>If you are in the EEA or UK</h2>
<p>Our legal bases are: performing a contract with you, our legitimate interest in running and securing the service, legal obligations, and
consent where we ask for it (you can withdraw it any time). You may access, correct, erase, restrict, object to or port your data, and complain to your
data protection authority. Data may be processed outside your country; see the list of providers above.</p>
{% endif %}

<h2>Children</h2>
<p>{{ f('app_title') }} is not aimed at children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect their data. If you think a child has given us data, tell us and we will delete it.</p>

<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>We will update the effective date when this policy changes.</p>
{% endblock %}
